# NAME: Apple-Intelligence
# AUTHOR: Giaohub
# REPO: https://github.com/Giaoogle/Surge/blob/main/Rule/Apple-Intelligence.list
# UPDATED: 2026-09-05
# DOMAIN: 10
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX: 2
# TOTAL: 12
#
# SOURCE: https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555
# Surge RULE-SET: policy is supplied by the calling profile.
# Place before broader Apple/iCloud/DIRECT rules in the calling profile.
# Routing rules alone do not determine Apple Intelligence availability.

# Apple-documented: Private Cloud Compute
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com

# Apple-documented: Apple Intelligence Extensions
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com

# Apple-documented: Siri, dictation and Search
# Preserve the existing guzzoni subdomain coverage for compatibility.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,guzzoni.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com

# Existing compatibility entries retained; not all are AI-specific.
# These are not asserted to be required AI endpoints by the source above.
DOMAIN,seed.siri.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net

# Shared services: Apple documents mask-api as iCloud Private Relay,
# and gateway as CloudKit content. Retained to preserve existing routing.
DOMAIN,mask-api.icloud.com
DOMAIN,gateway.icloud.com

# Existing location/configuration entries; AI necessity is unverified.
DOMAIN,configuration.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com

# Optional legacy broad match, disabled to limit unrelated traffic.
# Re-enable only if request logs demonstrate it is needed.
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aaplimg.com
